"2026-02-24T18:21:48Z","body":"I don't think you need two separate buttons for play/pause. I have never seen any audio player software/site where these actions are separated into two buttons.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3953900379/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3953933383","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116623#issuecomment-3953933383","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116623","id":3953933383,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rrDxH","user":{"login":"tvenclovas96","id":144885265,"node_id":"U_kgDOCKLGEQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144885265?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvenclovas96","html_url":"https://github.com/tvenclovas96","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvenclovas96/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvenclovas96/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvenclovas96/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvenclovas96/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvenclovas96/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvenclovas96/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvenclovas96/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvenclovas96/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvenclovas96/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-24T18:28:16Z","updated_at":"2026-02-24T18:28:16Z","body":"> I don't think you need two separate buttons for play/pause. I have never seen any audio player software/site where these actions are separated into two buttons.\r\n\